{"id":"c11b408c5a26a920","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender.md","title":"ZFC Largecard4 Extender","display":"df-zfc-largecard4-extender — ZFC Largecard4 Extender","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender","aliases":["58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender"],"display":"df-zfc-largecard4-extender — ZFC Largecard4 Extender","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-class]]","[[../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-largecard4-extender — ZFC Largecard4 Extender"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5578254565969219\" href=\"?note=5578254565969219\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(E,\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> are metatheoretic class parameters.</li>\n<li>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(a\\in[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inc}(a):|a|\\to\\lambda\">\\(\\operatorname{inc}(a):|a|\\to\\lambda\\)</span> is its increasing enumeration.</li>\n<li>类初等嵌入、传递类与类函数按 <code>58-df-class-embedding-data</code>；类映射位置的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}(j)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}\">\\(\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}\\)</span> 只量化元语言类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,V,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,V,M)\\)</span> (metatheoretic class predicates).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S(E,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\land\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}M,j\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,V,M)\\land\n\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land\\lambda\\leq j(\\kappa)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(E,[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\omega},\\operatorname{ran}(E))\\land\n\\forall a\\in[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(\nE(a)=\\{X\\subseteq\\kappa^{|a|}:\\operatorname{inc}(a)\\in j(X)\\}\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S(E,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\land\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}M,j\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,V,M)\\land\n\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land\\lambda\\leq j(\\kappa)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(E,[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\omega},\\operatorname{ran}(E))\\land\n\\forall a\\in[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(\nE(a)=\\{X\\subseteq\\kappa^{|a|}:\\operatorname{inc}(a)\\in j(X)\\}\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\((\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span>-extender derived from an elementary embedding; its component ultrafilters, coherence, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-completeness, and nonprincipality follow from that seed construction.</li>\n<li>The former clauses described only a coherent complete pre-extender and admitted degenerate principal systems. The class embedding is therefore exposed at the metatheoretic boundary.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","